#!/bin/zsh
S="Isometric miniature diorama on a dark charcoal base plate, warm sand and off-white surfaces, glossy dark reflective floor, soft warm lighting, tilt-shift miniature depth of field, 3D render, product-photography look. Small friendly white robots with round dark visors do the work; lime-green cubes are the work items. No text, no logos, no lettering, no signage."
./img.sh b1-desk "$S A glass-walled control room raised on a low platform at the left: one single human in a dark sweater sits at a desk with three softly glowing monitors, hands on the keyboard, seen from behind. Below and to the right the workshop floor is quiet: empty workbenches, an idle conveyor belt, no robots working yet."
./img.sh b2-read "$S A reading room: five small white robots stand at open filing drawers and wide tables covered with unrolled plans and blueprints, studying them closely. Cool deep blue light from the ceiling panels fills this room. Nothing is being assembled: the workbenches are bare, the conveyor belt is empty and still, there are no green cubes on it."
./img.sh b3-build "$S A build hall: six small white robots work at six separate parallel workbenches at the same time, each assembling its own lime-green cube, a warm amber work light above every bench. A conveyor belt runs past all six benches and carries finished cubes away to the right."
./img.sh b4-gate "$S A close view of one single illuminated gate arch spanning a conveyor belt. Lime-green cubes queue up on the belt and pass through the arch. One cube just past the arch glows deep red and is being pushed onto a short side belt that returns it backwards, while the cubes still queueing behind the arch glow green."
./img.sh b5-human "$S One single human in a dark sweater kneels on the workshop floor beside a small white robot at a workbench, holding one red-glowing cube in both hands and setting it right. Behind him a short flight of stairs leads up to a small glass control room."
